v0.4:
	support advert v2 (firmware version byte + boost status bits); parse both v1 and v2
	(bytes 0-11 unchanged, v2 moves the checksum and appends a firmware-version byte)

v0.3:
	fix: executable bits on setup/run scripts (PackageManager refused v0.2 with "setup file not executable")

v0.2:
	SetupHelper / PackageManager packaging
	configuration moved to the GX UI (tank Setup page), persisted in localsettings
	out-of-the-box calibration defaults (empty 500 mm, full 50 mm) so a level shows immediately
	one private D-Bus connection per tank service (fixes registration, enables multiple sensors)
	config.json removed

v0.1:
	initial beta: passive BLE scan via BlueZ D-Bus, com.victronenergy.tank services, config.json calibration
